<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Natbank announces three new board members.</title>
<headline>Austria Natbank announces three new board members.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank on Thursday announced the appointment of three new board members, adding that the bank's President Klaus Liebscher and chief executive Adolf Wala would remain in place.</p>
<p>The outgoing members were named as Klaus Muendl, Thomas Lachs, Peter Zdrahal and Dietmar Spranz.</p>
<p>They will be replaced by Wolfgang Duchatczek, Gertrude Tumpel-Gugerell and Erwin Tischler from July 15.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
</text>
